    },
    {
      "text": "Brand Sales Engine: A Focused Team and Design Philosophy",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144963",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "22px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "33px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "LBH Appliances' R&D department, led by founder Tina, brings together a team of exceptional engineers and designers. Committed to high-quality research and development and the pursuit of excellence, we secured over 40 patents within just four years of our inception.",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144227",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "32px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Our team's objective is to bring you the highest-quality new products available on the market. Great design begins with your ideas and suggestions; building upon this foundation, we identify your specific needs and leverage our manufacturing expertise to provide you with precise, tailored solutions.",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144227",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "32px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(51, 51, 51)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whenever we begin designing a new personal care appliance, we clear our minds and break free from established patterns of thought.",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144251",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "32px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "—— Chief Designer:Jeff",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144251",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "40px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Our facilities and equipment ensure both form and function.",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144229",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "22px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "33px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
      "text": "When creating prototypes, we pay close attention to every detail—from dimensions and shape to production costs and timelines.",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144254",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Subsequently, we fabricate molds based on the final design; this not only captures the product's precise form but also ensures that its intended functionality is realized during the production process.",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144254",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mold Flexibility",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144255",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "26.66px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Manufacturing Speed ​​and Cost",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144255",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "26.66px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Structural Stability",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144255",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "20px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "26.66px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Our three-step approach helps you maintain a competitive edge.",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144261",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "22px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "33px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn Your Ideas into Sketches in 15 Days",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144258",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "24px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "48px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ask",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144259",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "微软雅黑",
      "fontSize": "18px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "23.994px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Our experts provide honest and frank advice so that we can help turn all your product ideas into reality and set you up for success once you launch your project.",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144262",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Engineering and Quotation",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144263",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "微软雅黑",
      "fontSize": "18px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "23.994px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "To maintain transparency in our work, we provide detailed development pricing and explain how we engineer new personal care home appliances from the final design.",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144264",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mold design and processing are estimated and analyzed within 45 days",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144267",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "24px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "48px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Estimation and analysis",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144268",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "18px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "23.994px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "After studying your design and ideas, we'll estimate how much effort and time will be needed to create a clear timeline and keep you updated on development progress.",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144269",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "24px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mold making",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144270",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "Poppins",
      "fontSize": "18px",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "23.994px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "In our mold injection molding factory, we adjust molds to precise dimensions and create new models for rapid production.",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724144271",
      "main": true,
